WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Your eyes see letters. Your mind has learned to read.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The task: name the ink, not the word.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Two answers compete; the delay can be measured.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A suggestion changed some participants' performance.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Not everyone responded the same way.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A laboratory finding is not a promise about an audio product.
